    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield advanced investigative tools and immerse yourself in the intricacies of aviation disasters in 'Plane Accident: Prologue,' as you decipher the enigma of a plane crash using cutting-edge techniques and expert analysis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task will be <strong>to get to the site of the plane crash</strong>. With the help of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">such tools as a <strong>drone</strong> find the likely location of the plane wreckage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/d043fb2dea020afbc65b86e58a64ff33.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/d043fb2dea020afbc65b86e58a64ff33.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/d043fb2dea020afbc65b86e58a64ff33.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and <strong>Investigate the crash site</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/b57722e6118a0b0a68bbbebc9cbfc623.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/b57722e6118a0b0a68bbbebc9cbfc623.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/b57722e6118a0b0a68bbbebc9cbfc623.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to mark the area of the accident, <strong>find evidence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/efc7a6e0b19a167075b822a07676c4b7.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/efc7a6e0b19a167075b822a07676c4b7.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/efc7a6e0b19a167075b822a07676c4b7.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and take photos so that the entire plane wreckage is finally transported to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the hangar. Transporting the plane wreckage is only the beginning of your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">investigation. To get to the causes of the crash you will have to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>reconstruct the wreckage of the plane</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/29c040d50551444abfb9ba023477532f.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/29c040d50551444abfb9ba023477532f.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/29c040d50551444abfb9ba023477532f.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">send parts for analysis or <strong>examine the black box</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/e862c0ab8933270beb5f0beaca6fd638.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/e862c0ab8933270beb5f0beaca6fd638.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/e862c0ab8933270beb5f0beaca6fd638.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An integral part of any investigation is <strong>questioning witnesses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/c5eeca2f747d58547ef883887a5ee630.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/c5eeca2f747d58547ef883887a5ee630.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/c5eeca2f747d58547ef883887a5ee630.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and gathering all the clues to work out <strong>the true scenario</strong>of the cause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> of the crash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/01debcc7bc5363c0cc7299c2e93abba1.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/01debcc7bc5363c0cc7299c2e93abba1.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/01debcc7bc5363c0cc7299c2e93abba1.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a tantalizing glimpse of the aviation mystery world in Plane Accident: Prologue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But remember, what you see here is just the tip of the iceberg. Dive deeper into the full game to uncover a universe of secrets waiting to be revealed.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield advanced investigative tools and immerse yourself in the intricacies of aviation disasters in 'Plane Accident: Prologue,' as you decipher the enigma of a plane crash using cutting-edge techniques and expert analysis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your task will be <strong>to get to the site of the plane crash</strong>. With the help of </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">such tools as a <strong>drone</strong> find the likely location of the plane wreckage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/d043fb2dea020afbc65b86e58a64ff33.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/d043fb2dea020afbc65b86e58a64ff33.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/d043fb2dea020afbc65b86e58a64ff33.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and <strong>Investigate the crash site</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/b57722e6118a0b0a68bbbebc9cbfc623.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/b57722e6118a0b0a68bbbebc9cbfc623.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/b57722e6118a0b0a68bbbebc9cbfc623.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have to mark the area of the accident, <strong>find evidence</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/efc7a6e0b19a167075b822a07676c4b7.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/efc7a6e0b19a167075b822a07676c4b7.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/efc7a6e0b19a167075b822a07676c4b7.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and take photos so that the entire plane wreckage is finally transported to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the hangar. Transporting the plane wreckage is only the beginning of your</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">investigation. To get to the causes of the crash you will have to</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>reconstruct the wreckage of the plane</strong>,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/29c040d50551444abfb9ba023477532f.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/29c040d50551444abfb9ba023477532f.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/29c040d50551444abfb9ba023477532f.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">send parts for analysis or <strong>examine the black box</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/e862c0ab8933270beb5f0beaca6fd638.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/e862c0ab8933270beb5f0beaca6fd638.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/e862c0ab8933270beb5f0beaca6fd638.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An integral part of any investigation is <strong>questioning witnesses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/c5eeca2f747d58547ef883887a5ee630.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/c5eeca2f747d58547ef883887a5ee630.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/c5eeca2f747d58547ef883887a5ee630.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and gathering all the clues to work out <strong>the true scenario</strong>of the cause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> of the crash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/01debcc7bc5363c0cc7299c2e93abba1.poster.avif?t=1728891548\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/01debcc7bc5363c0cc7299c2e93abba1.webm?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2104670/extras/01debcc7bc5363c0cc7299c2e93abba1.mp4?t=1728891548\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a tantalizing glimpse of the aviation mystery world in Plane Accident: Prologue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But remember, what you see here is just the tip of the iceberg. Dive deeper into the full game to uncover a universe of secrets waiting to be revealed.</p>",
